event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":95,"item_id":"rs_01cc20c3b29fc771016aca0f947fa481949483bfd272aeeb73","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Analyzing project snapshot issues**\n\nI'm trying to figure out the issue with the project page snapshots showing no summary and just a list of requirements. It seems like there's a checkbox for \"Complete Source\" that remains unchecked. The counts across checkboxes suggest that maybe the first checkbox needs to be checked off, but it’s not. There could be a mix-up with UI updates and an incorrect destination because of this reset. Also, the test on multiple destinations might not have been adequately verified."}

event: response.reasoning_summary_part.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_part.done","sequence_number":96,"item_id":"rs_01cc20c3b29fc771016aca0f947fa481949483bfd272aeeb73","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"part":{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Analyzing project snapshot issues**\n\nI'm trying to figure out the issue with the project page snapshots showing no summary and just a list of requirements. It seems like there's a checkbox for \"Complete Source\" that remains unchecked. The counts across checkboxes suggest that maybe the first checkbox needs to be checked off, but it’s not. There could be a mix-up with UI updates and an incorrect destination because of this reset. Also, the test on multiple destinations might not have been adequately verified."}}

