event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":201,"item_id":"rs_01cc20c3b29fc771016aca0f947fa481949483bfd272aeeb73","output_index":0,"summary_index":1,"text":"**Addressing DOM control issues**\n\nI need to ensure that the DOM controls for unchanged rows are retained to avoid race conditions while preserving destination data after any re-renders. It's critical that the checkbox event completes after modifications before the move occurs. There seems to be an issue with counting the rows, likely due to how source and transferred rows are managed. I could improve the system to robustly handle task states and ensure only the relevant rows are removed. I'll also look into how the ElementHandle locators are stored to make sure the move is successful."}

event: response.reasoning_summary_part.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_part.done","sequence_number":202,"item_id":"rs_01cc20c3b29fc771016aca0f947fa481949483bfd272aeeb73","output_index":0,"summary_index":1,"part":{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Addressing DOM control issues**\n\nI need to ensure that the DOM controls for unchanged rows are retained to avoid race conditions while preserving destination data after any re-renders. It's critical that the checkbox event completes after modifications before the move occurs. There seems to be an issue with counting the rows, likely due to how source and transferred rows are managed. I could improve the system to robustly handle task states and ensure only the relevant rows are removed. I'll also look into how the ElementHandle locators are stored to make sure the move is successful."}}

event: response.output_item.done
data: {"type":"response.output_item.done","sequence_number":203,"output_index":0,"item":{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_01cc20c3b29fc771016aca0f947fa481949483bfd272aeeb73","summary":[{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Analyzing project snapshot issues**\n\nI'm trying to figure out the issue with the project page snapshots showing no summary and just a list of requirements. It seems like there's a checkbox for \"Complete Source\" that remains unchecked. The counts across checkboxes suggest that maybe the first checkbox needs to be checked off, but it’s not. There could be a mix-up with UI updates and an incorrect destination because of this reset. Also, the test on multiple destinations might not have been adequately verified."},{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Addressing DOM control issues**\n\nI need to ensure that the DOM controls for unchanged rows are retained to avoid race conditions while preserving destination data after any re-renders. It's critical that the checkbox event completes after modifications before the move occurs. There seems to be an issue with counting the rows, likely due to how source and transferred rows are managed. I could improve the system to robustly handle task states and ensure only the relevant rows are removed. I'll also look into how the ElementHandle locators are stored to make sure the move is successful."}],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABqyg-pLqRz7DdEFvt2_UtyBUw1oOnm9gNWBCwL3ToIuCMbpUv06jpDs1UwSH_lQ_u9Jk9dSOvWg9eVDO5UMndF7eqE6yQYo2J5AaU2zTy3PPWctGoV3TS-6WJr1m3O5x5J4yuCzYJWj9p-85C-52xVoDUrec6mIyL5iY4cAMr_BwPKybuMPaTPTGMDD0PoEpduNtzDbqS17CA048yj05Bf2TQ_9RrVhlL34pqrplSuUtGOEtsKBeYBm1lyQjJNBGul2iBKEilp2rbgOApbnIbQyoR3TiLKYaDwt0_p5mYn771_BP6-B3SeEFn7o7knkzYfpg-ErlkRi5YPLwUUP5JSo2YKfp9mk9zi_KOw8asyzcDyuXA2SuRhvZBGl1nDuWg0TBA201j5HPV4LVr98lBX3n9QQq_-9_2h7XRaOYN0AnuHZljR_ywzQSOjsXxjIzQMU9-J1FoQnLpcqaXks-3Wqc8TwXuhTozzuLjk2oZ0OoF8q79x7qJGv2olG-mPqoS-nHnBklPiaJZR6wyKqS2pwiKt3DcXfR46v6JFziFJdqXKtNT8bmx1I9aOoSXG3w8NFdEU3NpdMYDVP2VKDs10